---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${SITE.author}: a decade in technology, building solutions and driving enterprise transformations.`}>
  <header>
    <div class="kicker">About</div>
    <h1>A career is a nuanced response to the situations we're placed in.</h1>
    <p class="dek">The people, the technology, the macro forces, and the internal metamorphosis.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="prose no-dropcap">
    <p>
      I'm Lysander. I've spent a decade in technology, building solutions and driving enterprise transformations. This
      blog is where I share my views on tech and my experiments with the big-small and small-big problems along the way.
    </p>
    <p>
      Writing about the journey is my attempt to make it more meaningful, and perhaps to help a few fellow travellers
      along the way.
    </p>
    <p>Read along, and have fun.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  header {
    padding: 3.5rem 0 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 5.5vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .dek {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
